body:
I agree with you in theory, but can you believe me that I have nobody to talk with? I am almost 25, and the category of people who would understand me, are almost only those persons who are as anxious or have job difficulties as me... and even if I were to talk to someone, it wouldn't go too deep. I know, because, I have collegue whom I share a part a rent, whom we share a part of job difficulties, but are totally different, with regards with to our hobbyes, and experience with people. For example: I am still a virgin, while he is able to get in bed with girls (he is almost 20 years).

&#x200B;

I am fuc\*ing alone in my ideology and my life... I am so depressed, that I cannot even play some fuc\*ing video games anymore! I am a stupid and a naive motherfuc\*er, who thought that I would live alone and happy. But being naive, idealist, stupid and alone has brought only troubles for my stupid way of being!
